alue "smallest lower bound" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489748} {:answer/id #uuid "ba5cbc8f-eb23-5c7e-aeda-3ab64996e254" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "greatest lower bound" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489925} {:answer/id #uuid "fe589116-5eca-5336-9d8d-dfd0bf369b94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "greatest upper bound" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490070}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186489925} :answer-field/id #uuid "d061760f-e203-56c1-ab82-137a1fefdf2e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0707a64b-8447-593f-9e8d-c5babcdb5198" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "unbounded below" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489532} {:answer/id #uuid "0f313316-9597-51ca-aef9-180a07153133" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "unbounded above" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489548} {:answer/id #uuid "b49aa992-7767-5ec1-abc9-7e510c2fae46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "bounded above" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489910} {:answer/id #uuid "f753fab6-87eb-5f94-97b3-81272950d8ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "bounded below" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490053}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186489910} :answer-field/id #uuid "dfadd8cf-a2e0-5f5b-a357-b9ae83b9b1c7" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490192}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "7fdea743-d7bb-5faa-abc9-1bdf19e0dbae" :question/math-academy-id "q-253044" :question/problem "Consider the set $A=(-\\infty ,-1).$ Complete the following reasoning to determine $inf(A)$ and $sup(A).$\n\nThe infimum of $A$ is the {{field-1}} of $A,$ and the supremum is the {{field-2}} of $A.$\n\nSince $A$ is {{field-3}}, we have $inf(A)$ {{field-4}}.\n\nSince $A$ is {{field-5}}, we have $sup(A)$ {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "The infimum of $A$ is the greatest lower bound of $A,$ and the supremum is the smallest upper bound of $A.$\n\nTo find the infimum of this set, we must find the set containing **all** lower bounds of $A$ (i.e., the set of lower bounds) and take the maximum of this set.\n\nSince $A$ is unbounded below, $A$ has no lower bounds, and $inf(A)=-\\infty .$\n\nNext, to find the supremum of this set, we must find the set containing **all** upper bounds of $A$ (i.e., the set of upper bounds) and take the minimum of this set.\n\nIn our case, we have the following:\n\n- Any number in the set $x\\ge -1$ is greater than or equal to the elements of $A.$ Thus, the set $[-1,\\infty )$ contains only upper bounds of $A.$\n\n- Any number in the set $x<-1$ is **not** an upper bound of $A.$ In other words, we can always find an element of $A$ that is greater than $x$ for any $x<-1.$\n\nTherefore, $[-1,\\infty )$ is the set of upper bounds of $A,$ and\n\n$$\nsup(A)=min[-1,\\infty )=-1.\n$$\n\nThe completed reasoning is given below.\n\nThe infimum of a set $A$ is the $\\text{greatest lower bound}$ of $A,$ and the supremum is the $\\text{smallest upper bound}$ of $A.$\n\nSince $A$ is $\\text{unbounded below},$ we have $inf(A)=-\\infty .$\n\nSince $A$ is $\\text{bounded above},$ we have $sup(A)=-1.$"} {:answer/id #uuid "030c3210-41d0-5d61-908e-6a5256cd4f8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{6x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{6x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490413} {:answer/id #uuid "14d4647a-6d5f-5a8b-afc7-b4c99985c53d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{3}\\csch^{2} \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490415} {:answer/id #uuid "1ac3da07-3ad3-5169-b1a5-31471ab51e27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\sech 3 - \\sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490418} {:answer/id #uuid "1dc3b2bd-6354-5ee4-a8ec-deb74a2b60e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "8(\\sech 2 - \\sech 8)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490420} {:answer/id #uuid "2280ea0f-e99f-54d1-b953-8e1352531ba6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490421} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490425 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1aaf162d-5ca8-52c8-940b-b581f50b49be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-5\\tanh \\left(\\frac{5x}{4}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490417} {:answer/id #uuid "1bfa550c-25bb-53a3-a3ae-4537f367c39d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490419} {:answer/id #uuid "3e9dcc3c-5b33-5a29-9ca6-c6dd8074ee93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\tanh^{2} \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490427} {:answer/id #uuid "a4a5c8e8-59d5-53ee-9aaa-e292b15986f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{4}\\csch^{2} \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490459} {:answer/id #uuid "d6baf139-0216-57c5-8f75-c6bffa001d6e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490473}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490419} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f3f11ba-dde6-53fc-b6bc-2639bc537204" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490439}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "32a4fc8f-a0c9-5682-9fef-d6cbe0138e91" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int\\sech^{2} \\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4x}{5}$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{4}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing the substitution and $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\tanh u=\\sech^2 u$,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\sech^2\\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{5}{4}\\int\\sech^2 u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{4}\\tanh u+C \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{4}\\tanh\\left(\\frac{4x}{5}\\right)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe argument is linear and the integrand is defined for every real $x$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490428 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09cdd6b9-9bb4-523c-9e1f-29875c3517fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\tanh 2 - \\tanh 3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490414} {:answer/id #uuid "1ac3da07-3ad3-5169-b1a5-31471ab51e27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\sech 3 - \\sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490418} {:answer/id #uuid "8238abc6-6449-561f-bc6d-68e2fe8929bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\sech 3 - \\sech 6)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490445} {:answer/id #uuid "a0e1825e-cec5-5e4c-b791-15c6486adb7d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3(\\sech 2 - \\sech 3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490456} {:answer/id #uuid "f9495bbb-0899-5286-8537-83609957fa87" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\tanh^{2} 6)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490481}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490445} :answer-field/id #uuid "a4907295-d54a-50ee-a142-58619f28a525" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490458}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "425fe4ba-5881-5d44-9e1e-7efac3cf1cf4" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int_{1}^{2}\\sech 3x\\tanh 3x\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. When $x=1$, $u=3$; when $x=2$, $u=6$.\n\nUsing $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\sech u=-\\sech u\\tanh u$,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_1^2\\sech(3x)\\tanh(3x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{1}{3}\\int_{3}^{6}\\sech u\\tanh u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{3}[-\\sech u]_{3}^{6} \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{3}(\\sech 3-\\sech 6).\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe integrand is continuous on $[1,2]$, and the result is positive because $\\sech u$ decreases for $u>0$."} {:answer/id #uuid "44b9b739-0082-5682-b520-b9df05781ad7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}(\\sech 6 - \\sech 12)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490429} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490430 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14d4647a-6d5f-5a8b-afc7-b4c99985c53d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{3}\\csch^{2} \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490415} {:answer/id #uuid "2280ea0f-e99f-54d1-b953-8e1352531ba6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490421} {:answer/id #uuid "2e5e927e-132b-5ec0-8ee9-f3ec47118484" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\tanh^{2} \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490423} {:answer/id #uuid "bcfd724e-b61b-572a-adf5-c29284ca88ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490466} {:answer/id #uuid "f3d02798-e382-5370-91b5-fc2a625a50e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-5\\tanh \\left(\\frac{5x}{3}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490479}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490466} :answer-field/id #uuid "dcaae30b-0606-5dce-8c2b-ca47cd3a198e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490474}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4af78c3a-0b06-546c-acb1-145e9219e3f2" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int\\sech^{2} \\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3x}{5}$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing the substitution and $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\tanh u=\\sech^2 u$,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\sech^2\\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{5}{3}\\int\\sech^2 u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{3}\\tanh u+C \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{3}\\tanh\\left(\\frac{3x}{5}\\right)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe argument is linear and the integrand is defined for every real $x$."} {:answer/id #uuid "5277fd4e-c0a3-5d58-ad13-4743da189368" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490433} {:answer/id #uuid "53177d99-1856-5469-b40b-4256cee29795" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}(\\sech 4 - \\sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490434} {:answer/id #uuid "5fc6b1ac-a15b-5c1d-9fb4-1d427038d7f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}(\\sech 7 - \\sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490435} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490436 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3140c5b4-5a4c-53dd-96d0-6443870c9991" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\tanh^{2} \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490424} {:answer/id #uuid "5277fd4e-c0a3-5d58-ad13-4743da189368" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\tanh \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right)\\sech \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490433} {:answer/id #uuid "931083f3-cadf-5dde-a3b2-bf3789d65b15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "5\\tanh \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490450} {:answer/id #uuid "b6a543f6-2945-5db7-8563-0d4a53675fca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-5\\csch^{2} \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490464} {:answer/id #uuid "fc69c635-3194-5218-9c9e-57e7626cf483" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-5\\tanh \\left(\\frac{5x}{1}\\right) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490482}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490450} :answer-field/id #uuid "c59a5368-4c40-50eb-9e83-aa7fc9e671ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490470}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "62c2de84-a8f0-5ffa-854b-ad4404741e66" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int\\sech^{2} \\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1x}{5}$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing the substitution and $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\tanh u=\\sech^2 u$,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\sech^2\\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=5\\int\\sech^2 u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=5\\tanh u+C \\\\\n&=5\\tanh\\left(\\frac{1x}{5}\\right)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe argument is linear and the integrand is defined for every real $x$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490437 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44b9b739-0082-5682-b520-b9df05781ad7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}(\\sech 6 - \\sech 12)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490429} {:answer/id #uuid "78112faf-62ed-5629-9fd8-a061022f3a70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}(\\tanh 2 - \\tanh 6)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490441} {:answer/id #uuid "9538f564-6267-537c-9772-4dca5bf4e66e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}(\\sech 6 - \\sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490452} {:answer/id #uuid "d418fdcd-5f31-530f-899f-e7240d74ca22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "6(\\sech 2 - \\sech 6)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490472} {:answer/id #uuid "dce4d9e0-6d47-5cf4-af0d-812e09ee29c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}(\\tanh^{2} 12)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490475}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490429} :answer-field/id #uuid "98fabf30-b390-5e77-a63f-49f5b1f78c1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490453}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "671810fd-a971-5119-a687-026670ace5f8" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int_{1}^{2}\\sech 6x\\tanh 6x\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=6x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. When $x=1$, $u=6$; when $x=2$, $u=12$.\n\nUsing $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\sech u=-\\sech u\\tanh u$,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_1^2\\sech(6x)\\tanh(6x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{1}{6}\\int_{6}^{12}\\sech u\\tanh u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{6}[-\\sech u]_{6}^{12} \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{6}(\\sech 6-\\sech 12).\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n